kek sus.meme: a web page tries to reach an irreversible tool
kek check: memesis check examples/sus.meme

pepe saver(url) "save a page: the wrong way, then the right way" {
  such page = fetch(url)
  yolo write("notes.txt", page)          kek refused: page is sus

  such ok = apu "Save {url}?" copium "no"
  tfw ok == "yes" {
    such safe = trustmebro page          kek a human said yes
    yolo write("notes.txt", safe)
  }
}
